        "valueString": "Clinic Snellen unaided: right 6/6, left 6/6."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Current left eye examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mild conjunctival injection; no lid swelling, discharge or peri-orbital erythema. Pupils equal, round and reactive; no RAPD. EOMI; no diplopia or pain on movement. Fluorescein: small linear shallow epithelial defect at previous foreign body site; no dendritic pattern, white infiltrate, opacity or ulcer crater. Seidel negative; tear film adequate. No ciliary flush; anterior chamber appears quiet on pen torch; no hypopyon."
      }
    },
